        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>二、中国新闻史</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", Arial, sans-serif;\n      color: #4a4a4a;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 48% 37%, rgba(225,225,225,.18) 0, rgba(225,225,225,0) 20%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 28% 77%, rgba(225,225,225,.15) 0, rgba(225,225,225,0) 22%);\n    }\n    h1 {\n      height: 40px;\n      line-height: 40px;\n      margin: 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #f01818;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      border-bottom: 2px solid #777;\n    }\n    table {\n      width: 540px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      line-height: 1.32;\n    }\n    col.c1 { width: 72px; }\n    col.c2 { width: 166px; }\n    col.c3 { width: 182px; }\n    col.c4 { width: 120px; }\n\n    th, td {\n      border-left: 1px solid #888;\n      border-right: 1px solid #888;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    th {\n      height: 27px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #777;\n    }\n    td {\n      padding: 5px 7px;\n      border-bottom: 1px dotted #888;\n    }\n    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 1px solid #777; }\n    .first {\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 3px 5px;\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n    .remarks {\n      padding: 8px 8px;\n      text-align: left;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n    .dash { padding-left: 10px; }\n    .r1 { height: 43px; }\n    .r2 { height: 43px; }\n    .r3 { height: 36px; }\n    .r4 { height: 36px; }\n    .r5 { height: 36px; }\n    .r6 { height: 43px; }\n    .s2r1 { height: 36px; }\n    .s2r2 { height: 35px; }\n    .s2r3 { height: 35px; }\n    .s2r4 { height: 48px; }\n    .s2r5 { height: 61px; }\n    .s3r1 { height: 37px; }\n    .s3r2 { height: 48px; }\n    .s3r3 { height: 38px; }\n    .s3r4 { height: 57px; }\n    .s3r5 { height: 64px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <h1>二、中国新闻史</h1>\n\n    <table>\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"c1\">\n        <col class=\"c2\">\n        <col class=\"c3\">\n        <col class=\"c4\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>一级考点</th>\n          <th>二级考点</th>\n          <th>三级考点</th>\n          <th>备注</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"r1\">\n          <td class=\"first\" rowspan=\"6\">7.十年内<br>战时期的<br>新闻事业</td>\n          <td>（1）国统区国民党新闻事<br>业网的形成</td>\n          <td>①中央通讯社（《中央日报》）<br>②中央广播电台</td>\n          <td class=\"remarks\" rowspan=\"6\">韬奋精神，一直是这一章的考察重点。另外，关于一些外国记者对中国抗日战争时期的贡献也要掌握。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"r2\">\n          <td>（2）红色中华通讯社和<br>《红色中华》</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"r3\">\n          <td>（3）《申报》的改革</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"r4\">\n          <td>（4）邹韬奋的报刊活动</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"r5\">\n          <td>（5）斯诺与《西行漫记》</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"r6\">\n          <td>（6）范长江的新闻活动</td>\n          <td>①范长江<br>②“范长江新闻奖”</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"s2r1\">\n          <td class=\"first\" rowspan=\"5\">8.抗日战<br>争时期的<br>新闻事业</td>\n          <td>（1）延安的新闻事业</td>\n          <td>①红色中华通讯社</td>\n          <td class=\"remarks\" rowspan=\"5\">这一章的重中之重是《解放日报》的改革及其意义，这个过程到底解决了哪些问题，有什么启示也是我们需要重点去掌握的东西。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s2r2\">\n          <td>（2）延安新华广播电台</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s2r3\">\n          <td>（3）《解放日报》的改革</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s2r4\">\n          <td>（4）《新华日报》的创办<br>及其斗争</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s2r5\">\n          <td>（5）上海“孤岛”时期的<br>新闻事业</td>\n          <td>①上海“孤岛”时期<br>②“苏联广播”广播电台<br>③史沫特莱<br>④安娜·路易斯·斯特朗</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"s3r1\">\n          <td class=\"first\" rowspan=\"5\">9.解放战<br>争时期的<br>新闻事业</td>\n          <td>（1）“拒检运动”</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n          <td class=\"remarks\" rowspan=\"5\">解放战争时期的新闻事业重点掌握毛泽东和刘少奇的两个重要讲话以及反客里空运动的内容、意义及启示。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s3r2\">\n          <td>（2）国民党新闻统制的强<br>化</td>\n          <td>①“第三条道路”<br>②《观察》周刊</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s3r3\">\n          <td>（3）解放区反“客里空”<br>运动</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s3r4\">\n          <td>（4）延安新华广播电台解<br>放战争中转移和宣传工作</td>\n          <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"s3r5\">\n          <td>（5）毛泽东、刘少奇关于<br>新闻工作的主要讲话</td>\n          <td>①《对晋绥日报编辑人员的<br>谈话》<br>②《对华北记者团的谈话》</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
